### 2. Quadrifilar Helix (QFH) Antenna (Circular Polarization)
* **Design Purpose:** Constructed to provide circular polarization, optimizing reception for overhead satellite passes compared to linear dipoles[cite: 5].
* **Bidirectional Link Testing:** Paired with the V-Dipole in controlled two-way transmit-receive tests (QFH $\rightarrow$ V-Dipole and V-Dipole $\rightarrow$ QFH) to verify functional RF links in both configurations[cite: 5, 9].
